### Backend and Database

- Use Supabase for backend services, including authentication and database interactions.
- Follow Supabase guidelines for security and performance.
- Use FluentValidation schemas to validate data exchanged with the backend.
- Use supabase integration in asp.net by NuGet
- Supabase PostgreSQL is the single source of truth for all application data.
- Use EF Core code-first migrations.
- Supabase Auth manage
- The backend trusts Supabase JWT and does not implement local authentication.
- Never store or process passwords on the backend.